    "overview": "CHEM101 is a calm study companion for a Russian-speaking beginner preparing for an English-language chemistry exam. Cream paper, forest ink, editorial headings, and restrained rules make each screen feel like an approachable printed workbook.\n\nThe workspace supports learning, practice, timed exams, and reviewing errors. Comfortable reading and clear task states take priority over decorative dashboard chrome. Illustrations explain chemistry; progress and feedback communicate actual study state.",
    "dos": [
      "**Do** preserve cream paper, forest ink, and the Lora/Manrope pairing.",
      "**Do** use ruled lists for curriculum and review content.",
      "**Do** retain visible keyboard focus and explicit answer-state cues.",
      "**Do** keep problem text, chemistry notation, and solution steps readable before adding decoration."
    ]
